WEBVTT

01:49.450 --> 01:54.960
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.030 --> 01:57.910
[Episode 18]

02:00.400 --> 02:01.800
I've thought it through.

02:02.590 --> 02:04.070
Song Yimeng is my legitimate wife,

02:04.070 --> 02:06.130
whom I went to great lengths to marry.

02:06.560 --> 02:07.620
That makes Mr. Song

02:07.840 --> 02:09.000
my father-in-law.

02:09.430 --> 02:11.120
It is only right that I take punishment

02:11.120 --> 02:12.850
on behalf of my father-in-law.

02:14.470 --> 02:15.430
In that case,

02:16.840 --> 02:18.520
I'll grant your wish.

02:23.030 --> 02:23.910
Eunuch Liu.

02:24.870 --> 02:26.329
Carry out the punishment.

02:39.920 --> 02:45.480
♪ I leave the book aside, though I haven't finished reading it ♪

02:48.860 --> 02:54.600
♪ I know one day I can have a glimpse of the ending ♪

02:57.680 --> 03:01.680
♪ Life is unpredictable ♪

03:02.740 --> 03:05.560
♪ Who can get rid of perplexity ♪

03:05.000 --> 03:06.360
I want to make a bet with you.

03:05.050 --> 03:08.750
[One hour ago]

03:06.530 --> 03:11.130
♪ And find the answer he yearns for? ♪

03:07.840 --> 03:09.120
Don't you want to know

03:10.030 --> 03:13.190
how much Heng truly cares about Song Yimeng?

03:15.270 --> 03:18.420
♪ I let the wind stir my pages of the past ♪

03:19.840 --> 03:22.810
♪ Let brush and ink depict my adventures ♪

03:24.190 --> 03:30.760
♪ Let's see how many ways fate can shape my life in ♪

03:33.270 --> 03:36.710
♪ Let the moonlight shine on the lines about love and hate ♪

03:37.710 --> 03:41.270
♪ Let me bang my head against a brick wall ♪

03:42.050 --> 03:48.280
♪ If this is my destiny, I'll accept it ♪

03:54.910 --> 03:55.710
Your Majesty,

03:55.910 --> 03:58.000
the thirty lashes are complete.

04:04.530 --> 04:07.800
♪ Wind, be with me in the quest for an ideal ♪

04:08.820 --> 04:11.860
♪ Brush and ink, stand with me on the cliff ♪

04:13.280 --> 04:19.660
♪ My heart measures the waves I've cleaved ♪

04:15.030 --> 04:16.230
Didn't you say

04:16.959 --> 04:19.300
my birthday is in ten days and that no blood

04:19.560 --> 04:21.220
should be spilled until then?

04:22.200 --> 04:25.650
♪ Setting sun, help me weather through the big snow ♪

04:26.650 --> 04:30.970
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter to get sorrowful ♪

04:33.490 --> 04:41.590
♪ Every word resonates with me like dancing notes on the paper ♪

04:33.560 --> 04:34.520
But now

04:35.070 --> 04:36.680
there's blood.

04:42.800 --> 04:44.600
What punishment do you deserve?

04:55.930 --> 05:00.330
[Never Tired of Learning]

05:05.630 --> 05:06.600
So you're saying

05:07.270 --> 05:10.130
His Majesty did this to take your military command?

05:10.920 --> 05:12.480
It's just a marriage.

05:12.920 --> 05:14.580
He would never bear the charge

05:14.630 --> 05:16.480
of killing a minister over this.

05:17.310 --> 05:19.040
But how did you figure that out?

05:20.950 --> 05:23.010
If you'd lived under someone's thumb

05:23.040 --> 05:24.800
since the age of nine,

05:26.270 --> 05:27.730
you'd understand him too.

05:28.390 --> 05:29.250
Your Highness.

05:31.240 --> 05:32.440
Be careful. It's hot.

05:34.190 --> 05:35.800
You saved Mr. Song today.

05:36.070 --> 05:38.240
I'm sure he'll agree to this marriage.

05:38.600 --> 05:39.900
In this case,

05:39.950 --> 05:41.720
not only will you have to go to your fief,

05:41.720 --> 05:44.070
but also deploy 10,000 soldiers to the east.

05:44.070 --> 05:46.130
Your power will be greatly weakened.

05:52.560 --> 05:54.460
Go and get Li Shiliu's clothes.

05:55.190 --> 05:55.920
Your Highness,

05:55.920 --> 05:56.950
you're badly injured.

05:56.950 --> 05:58.080
Where are you going?

05:59.040 --> 06:01.240
Isn't someone on a hunger strike to resist the imperial order?

06:01.240 --> 06:02.240
I need to go and see

06:02.600 --> 06:04.190
what she's up to.

06:22.940 --> 06:26.200
Aren't you on a hunger strike to resist the imperial order?

06:26.830 --> 06:27.880
Mr. Li?

06:30.830 --> 06:31.840
Mr. Li,

06:32.000 --> 06:32.920
I knew

06:33.120 --> 06:35.159
you still consider me a good friend.

06:35.159 --> 06:35.830
Right?

06:36.680 --> 06:37.630
How have you been?

06:37.630 --> 06:38.270
Well,

06:38.270 --> 06:40.070
did Nan Heng give you a hard time?

06:44.270 --> 06:45.070
I see.

06:49.560 --> 06:50.360
No.

06:51.159 --> 06:53.090
Nan Heng didn't give me a hard time.

06:53.270 --> 06:54.630
He knows our Waning River Crescent

06:54.630 --> 06:56.000
is searching for the method of weapon forging.

06:56.000 --> 06:56.800
So,

06:57.270 --> 06:59.200
he just wants to cooperate with me.

06:59.430 --> 07:00.450
That's good.

07:08.430 --> 07:09.800
Mr. Li, don't just stand there.

07:09.800 --> 07:10.600
Come, have a seat.

07:10.600 --> 07:11.720
Here, sit down.

07:34.560 --> 07:35.120
Mr. Li,

07:35.120 --> 07:36.680
your clothes look great.

07:36.680 --> 07:37.630
Where did you get them made?

07:37.630 --> 07:39.090
Take me with you next time.

07:40.159 --> 07:41.630
Shangguan He had someone make them.

07:41.630 --> 07:43.430
If you like them...

07:44.040 --> 07:44.830
No need.

07:46.720 --> 07:47.510
No need.

07:48.750 --> 07:49.830
Let me explain.

07:49.950 --> 07:50.750
Mr. Li,

07:51.310 --> 07:53.040
you don't need to explain to me.

07:53.480 --> 07:55.430
Didn't I tell you last time?

07:56.190 --> 07:57.000
I understand.

07:57.159 --> 07:58.190
I understand everything.

07:58.190 --> 07:59.430
What do you understand?

07:59.430 --> 08:00.000
Shangguan He and I...

08:00.000 --> 08:00.390
Let the past

08:00.390 --> 08:01.630
be the past,

08:01.630 --> 08:03.960
alright? Let's not talk about it anymore.

08:12.910 --> 08:13.720
Mr. Li,

08:14.430 --> 08:15.680
there's actually

08:16.360 --> 08:17.390
something very important

08:17.390 --> 08:18.850
I want to discuss with you.

08:34.490 --> 08:37.289
[The 4th day of Pingrong Battle]

08:34.549 --> 08:35.750
But, Junior General,

08:36.030 --> 08:37.720
you've already sent out so many carrier pigeons.

08:37.720 --> 08:39.080
If Seventh Prince were willing to send troops,

08:37.970 --> 08:41.220
[Scout of Qianyu Army]

08:39.080 --> 08:39.909
they would have come by now.

08:39.909 --> 08:41.640
How could it still be like this?

08:42.270 --> 08:43.600
What happened back then

08:43.960 --> 08:44.960
was my fault.

08:46.030 --> 08:47.630
I shouldn't have doubted him

08:48.200 --> 08:50.260
and left him alone in the cold palace.

08:51.870 --> 08:53.730
As long as he can help me this once,

08:54.030 --> 08:55.390
I'm willing to atone

08:55.390 --> 08:56.590
for my past mistakes,

08:57.080 --> 08:59.030
no matter the cost.

08:59.960 --> 09:00.750
I'm...

09:03.150 --> 09:04.440
begging him.

09:05.280 --> 09:08.160
[The 6th day of Pingrong Battle]

09:08.870 --> 09:09.790
Is it the Junior General's fault

09:09.790 --> 09:11.320
that he refused to help?

09:12.440 --> 09:14.510
If he hadn't pinned his hopes on that God of Death,

09:14.510 --> 09:16.270
we could have tried other tactics long ago!

09:16.270 --> 09:18.600
We wouldn't have been besieged like this!

09:21.480 --> 09:22.240
Chu Guihong,

09:22.960 --> 09:24.270
the Song family is in trouble today.

09:24.270 --> 09:26.340
Why don't we put aside our old grudges

09:26.480 --> 09:27.840
and deal with this together?

09:27.840 --> 09:28.700
What do you say?

09:30.120 --> 09:31.520
I've thought it through.

09:32.360 --> 09:33.870
Song Yimeng is my legitimate wife,

09:33.870 --> 09:36.060
whom I went to great lengths to marry.

09:36.200 --> 09:37.260
That makes Mr. Song

09:37.440 --> 09:38.550
my father-in-law.

09:39.090 --> 09:40.840
It is only right that I take punishment

09:40.840 --> 09:42.570
on behalf of my father-in-law.

09:58.150 --> 09:58.960
What?

10:00.390 --> 10:02.120
Even you are laughing at me now?

10:11.440 --> 10:12.840
What did I teach you?

10:15.030 --> 10:15.870
Horses

10:16.300 --> 10:17.390
are meant to be ridden

10:17.390 --> 10:18.510
and used by people.

10:18.870 --> 10:19.660
Get up!

10:21.960 --> 10:22.750
Father?

10:27.720 --> 10:28.510
Father!

10:50.840 --> 10:52.010
Foolish boy,

10:52.080 --> 10:53.910
life is long.

10:52.280 --> 10:55.210
[Years ago on a battlefield at the frontier]

10:54.030 --> 10:56.960
A single success or failure doesn't make or break a hero.

10:56.960 --> 10:57.750
Look.

10:58.120 --> 10:59.600
These are all your soldiers,

10:59.600 --> 11:00.870
your backbone.

11:01.910 --> 11:02.860
Sooner or later,

11:03.120 --> 11:04.870
I'll hand Yulong and Qianyu Army

11:04.870 --> 11:06.580
over to you.

11:06.630 --> 11:07.720
The battlefield in the capital

11:07.720 --> 11:09.180
is much tougher than this.

11:09.360 --> 11:11.510
In the future, when you assist Rui in dealing with Nan Heng,

11:11.510 --> 11:12.970
you must completely let go

11:13.120 --> 11:14.520
of your past friendship.

11:21.000 --> 11:21.920
You're

11:22.080 --> 11:23.280
loyal and righteous,

11:23.840 --> 11:26.630
but your loyalty and righteousness are holding you back.

11:26.630 --> 11:28.090
Do you remember that book?

11:28.670 --> 11:29.480
Father,

11:29.870 --> 11:30.750
Nan Heng said

11:30.790 --> 11:32.470
he already burned the Qianyu Military Manual.

11:32.470 --> 11:34.320
Didn't you also send people to search for it?

11:34.320 --> 11:35.720
Why don't you believe it?

11:37.870 --> 11:38.670
Promise me,

11:39.320 --> 11:40.390
if one day

11:40.390 --> 11:42.520
you find Nan Heng still has that thing,

11:43.000 --> 11:44.720
you must destroy it completely.

11:44.720 --> 11:47.050
It contains the method of weapon forging.

11:48.320 --> 11:49.440
Do you hear me?

11:56.200 --> 11:57.190
Chu Guihong,

11:57.240 --> 11:58.790
if anyone dares bully you in the future,

11:58.790 --> 11:59.670
just tell me.

11:59.670 --> 12:01.330
I'll take care of them for you.

12:02.790 --> 12:04.000
You're just bragging.

12:04.000 --> 12:07.060
I'm the one who's been dealing with the eunuchs for you.

12:24.120 --> 12:25.450
Killing Nan Heng again?

12:26.000 --> 12:26.960
Mr. Li,

12:26.960 --> 12:28.120
calm down.

12:28.200 --> 12:29.120
We're not killing him—

12:29.120 --> 12:30.250
we're exposing him.

12:31.630 --> 12:32.500
You see,

12:32.600 --> 12:35.550
Nan Heng wants to search for the method of weapon forging with you.

12:35.550 --> 12:38.440
You must have evidence that he has been secretly researching the forbidden method.

12:38.440 --> 12:40.270
If we hand this evidence

12:40.270 --> 12:41.720
to His Majesty,

12:41.960 --> 12:43.360
his rebellious ambition

12:43.360 --> 12:44.630
will be fully revealed.

12:44.630 --> 12:46.440
By then, we won't even need to act—

12:46.440 --> 12:47.510
he'll be doomed.

12:47.630 --> 12:48.440
Our engagement

12:48.440 --> 12:49.840
will collapse on its own.

12:52.630 --> 12:53.890
Rebellious ambition?

12:55.290 --> 12:56.240
Even now,

12:56.240 --> 12:57.200
your opinion of Nan Heng

12:57.200 --> 12:58.460
hasn't changed at all?

13:10.200 --> 13:11.000
It has.

13:12.670 --> 13:13.480
I know

13:15.320 --> 13:17.650
he's not just a one-dimensional villain.

13:20.240 --> 13:21.870
He's a living person.

13:27.600 --> 13:28.870
Also, his suspicion,

13:29.360 --> 13:30.150
cunning,

13:30.480 --> 13:31.270
and ruthlessness

13:31.270 --> 13:32.930
all have reasons behind them.

13:33.720 --> 13:35.010
Since I was nine,

13:35.270 --> 13:37.130
I was banished to the cold palace,

13:37.390 --> 13:38.440
bullied,

13:38.440 --> 13:39.200
and left hungry.

13:39.200 --> 13:40.510
If it weren't for being trapped

13:40.510 --> 13:42.440
in the cold palace all those years,

13:42.480 --> 13:44.670
and for every time he fought desperately

13:44.670 --> 13:46.150
on the battlefield

13:46.150 --> 13:48.350
only to be treated unfairly afterward,

13:51.030 --> 13:54.160
he wouldn't have become the Nan Heng he is today, I think.

13:56.390 --> 13:58.120
Since you understand all this,

13:58.550 --> 14:00.350
why do you still want to harm him?

14:02.390 --> 14:03.910
How is that harming him?

14:04.270 --> 14:06.000
He's the one who wants to find the method of weapon forging.

14:06.000 --> 14:08.360
And rebellion is something he will definitely attempt in the future.

14:08.360 --> 14:10.510
It's true that I want to expose him early

14:10.510 --> 14:12.440
to save my own life,

14:12.670 --> 14:13.670
but I also want to prevent

14:13.670 --> 14:15.550
more people from getting hurt.

14:15.550 --> 14:16.670
Why can't you understand,

14:16.670 --> 14:17.480
Mr. Li?

14:25.240 --> 14:27.630
You'd rather believe in vague fate

14:27.630 --> 14:29.320
than trust a living, breathing person.

14:29.320 --> 14:30.720
How do you expect me to understand?

14:30.720 --> 14:32.380
Besides, from what I've seen,

14:32.790 --> 14:33.910
Nan Heng has been sincere with you.

14:33.910 --> 14:35.640
How could he possibly kill you?

14:37.960 --> 14:40.360
Mr. Li, why are you acting so strange today?

14:40.440 --> 14:42.320
Why do you keep defending him?

14:45.960 --> 14:47.240
Am I wrong?

14:50.150 --> 14:51.950
Maybe he doesn't want to kill me,

14:52.390 --> 14:54.650
but I will definitely die because of him.

14:54.960 --> 14:55.870
This is the rule.

14:55.870 --> 14:56.670
It's fate.

14:57.080 --> 14:58.120
Then break the rule

14:58.120 --> 14:59.270
and destroy fate.

14:59.360 --> 15:00.620
You don't understand.

15:00.720 --> 15:02.670
This fate can't be destroyed.

15:02.670 --> 15:04.600
The iconic scene will inevitably happen.

15:04.600 --> 15:05.440
Right now,

15:05.440 --> 15:06.670
we can only use the rule

15:06.670 --> 15:08.110
and strike first.

15:14.240 --> 15:16.040
But have you thought about this—

15:16.600 --> 15:19.470
if his search for the method of weapon forging becomes public,

15:19.470 --> 15:21.070
His Majesty will be enraged,

15:22.000 --> 15:23.200
and Nan Heng will die.

15:26.960 --> 15:28.020
Or do you simply...

15:30.390 --> 15:32.250
not care whether he lives or dies?

15:33.870 --> 15:34.670
I...

15:36.030 --> 15:37.030
Not really.

15:38.320 --> 15:39.240
I just...

15:40.630 --> 15:41.630
It's just that...

15:42.850 --> 15:48.410
♪ I leave the book aside, though I haven't finished reading it ♪

15:45.120 --> 15:46.120
It's just that...

15:48.200 --> 15:49.320
you're even cruel

15:51.360 --> 15:52.480
and more ruthless than he is.

15:51.790 --> 15:57.400
♪ I know one day I can have a glimpse of the ending ♪

16:00.610 --> 16:04.730
♪ Life is unpredictable ♪

16:05.560 --> 16:08.510
♪ Who can get rid of perplexity ♪

16:09.460 --> 16:13.980
♪ And find the answer he yearns for? ♪

16:15.990 --> 16:16.790
Mr. Li.

16:18.060 --> 16:21.300
♪ I let the wind stir my pages of the past ♪

16:18.150 --> 16:18.960
Mr. Li.

16:22.000 --> 16:23.030
Mr. Li.

16:22.510 --> 16:25.780
♪ Let brush and ink depict my adventures ♪

16:26.950 --> 16:27.940
Mr. Li.

16:27.020 --> 16:33.520
♪ Let's see how many ways fate can shape my life in ♪

16:35.780 --> 16:39.260
♪ Let the moonlight shine on the lines about love and hate ♪

16:36.790 --> 16:37.870
If I had a choice,

16:38.630 --> 16:40.440
I wouldn't want anything to happen to him either.

16:40.440 --> 16:44.010
♪ Let me bang my head against a brick wall ♪

16:44.980 --> 16:51.290
♪ If this is my destiny, I'll accept it ♪

17:07.290 --> 17:11.099
♪ Wind, be with me in the quest for an ideal ♪

17:11.930 --> 17:15.240
♪ Brush and ink, stand with me on the cliff ♪

17:16.390 --> 17:23.030
♪ My heart measures the waves I've cleaved ♪

17:25.380 --> 17:28.880
♪ Setting sun, help me weather through the big snow ♪

17:29.690 --> 17:34.450
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter to get sorrowful ♪

17:36.570 --> 17:44.680
♪ Every word resonates with me like dancing notes on the paper ♪

17:38.240 --> 17:39.440
What are you two doing here?

17:39.440 --> 17:40.070
Who is it?

17:42.960 --> 17:44.880
Shangguan, you're finally here.

17:45.510 --> 17:47.550
Last night, Chief Master came back from the Song Residence

17:47.550 --> 17:49.680
and locked himself in all night.

17:50.720 --> 17:51.960
He spent the whole night sharpening his blade?

17:51.960 --> 17:52.750
No.

17:52.920 --> 17:54.270
I'd rather he did that.

17:54.400 --> 17:56.160
There's no sound from inside—

17:56.160 --> 17:57.240
it's eerily quiet.

17:57.400 --> 17:58.680
Yunlong and I are worried.

17:58.680 --> 18:00.480
Do you think Chief Master might…

18:03.070 --> 18:04.310
You two go and do something else.

18:04.310 --> 18:05.570
I'll handle this here.

18:15.270 --> 18:16.070
Forget it.

18:41.350 --> 18:43.550
Why are you sitting here without a word?

18:48.200 --> 18:49.790
You're injured, and you drank that much.

18:49.790 --> 18:50.790
Do you want to die?

18:57.030 --> 18:58.030
I see.

18:59.000 --> 19:00.960
You went to see someone last night,

19:01.240 --> 19:02.750
and she upset you again.

19:06.830 --> 19:08.960
She doesn't care whether I live or die.

19:11.590 --> 19:13.270
But that's not surprising.

19:13.830 --> 19:15.290
I should have expected it.

19:16.680 --> 19:18.160
Then why are you so down?

19:18.960 --> 19:20.640
I told you,

19:21.030 --> 19:22.440
this game of playing two roles

19:22.440 --> 19:24.270
will only trap you.

19:24.550 --> 19:25.350
See?

19:25.640 --> 19:26.640
Just as I thought.

19:29.070 --> 19:30.470
So what should you do now?

19:31.200 --> 19:32.590
Cut off all your feelings for her

19:32.590 --> 19:33.750
and get rid of her?

19:41.310 --> 19:42.640
Unfortunately, she can kill me,

19:42.640 --> 19:44.030
but I can't kill her.

19:45.510 --> 19:46.510
I know.

19:48.030 --> 19:49.120
Even if you could,

19:49.590 --> 19:51.990
I know you couldn't bring yourself to do it.

19:53.720 --> 19:55.270
But I have to remind you.

19:55.480 --> 19:56.720
About the engagement,

19:56.720 --> 19:57.510
you finally seized it

19:57.510 --> 19:59.480
from Chu Guihong.

19:59.830 --> 20:02.030
If you act on impulse

20:02.030 --> 20:03.790
and think about giving it up now,

20:03.790 --> 20:06.250
everything you've done will be for nothing.

20:09.350 --> 20:10.950
How did you become so haggard

20:11.070 --> 20:12.830
after just one day apart?

20:14.950 --> 20:16.120
Don't mention it.

20:16.920 --> 20:18.640
Mr. Li's words

20:18.720 --> 20:20.270
nearly broke me.

20:22.270 --> 20:24.270
I need to eat something and recover.

20:24.350 --> 20:25.550
Oh, Master…

20:25.550 --> 20:26.960
He came back from the palace last night

20:26.960 --> 20:27.790
with a dark face

20:27.790 --> 20:28.640
and refused to see anyone.

20:28.640 --> 20:31.370
We couldn't even get the chance to plead with him.

20:33.030 --> 20:33.750
My father

20:33.750 --> 20:35.230
is still not giving up.

20:35.400 --> 20:38.270
He's trying everything he can to break off the engagement.

20:38.270 --> 20:39.070
What a pity.

20:39.350 --> 20:40.810
He won't get what he wants.

20:41.640 --> 20:42.880
How do you know?

20:44.270 --> 20:46.000
It's a fixed setting that Nan Heng

20:46.000 --> 20:48.600
wants the Song family's power, even if he dies.

20:49.030 --> 20:49.720
I'd better

20:49.720 --> 20:51.480
save my strength

20:51.480 --> 20:54.080
and figure out how to convince Mr. Li to help me.

20:57.790 --> 21:00.040
[Gentle Breeze]

21:01.000 --> 21:01.640
Your Highness,

21:01.640 --> 21:02.720
you're finally back.

21:02.720 --> 21:03.640
Mr. Song has been

21:03.640 --> 21:06.040
waiting for quite a while in the residence.

21:13.510 --> 21:14.480
Your Highness.

21:15.160 --> 21:16.790
I didn't know you were visiting.

21:16.790 --> 21:18.250
Sorry to keep you waiting.

21:18.310 --> 21:19.110
Please, sit.

21:23.880 --> 21:25.810
Your Highness, you're too polite.

21:26.270 --> 21:27.070
You...

21:28.240 --> 21:29.790
took the punishment for me,

21:29.960 --> 21:32.160
so of course I should come and thank you.

21:33.640 --> 21:35.920
These are some medicines I prepared

21:35.920 --> 21:37.200
for your lash wounds.

21:37.790 --> 21:40.030
Please accept them.

21:41.200 --> 21:42.070
Thank you.

21:53.160 --> 21:54.490
I assume you didn't come

21:55.070 --> 21:57.200
just to deliver medicine? Indeed not.

22:01.310 --> 22:03.110
I'm here because I have something

22:03.110 --> 22:05.480
I'd like to ask you, Your Highness.

22:08.960 --> 22:09.830
Your Highness,

22:10.640 --> 22:13.500
what you did outside the Imperial Study yesterday—

22:14.240 --> 22:15.920
how much of it was sincere,

22:16.640 --> 22:18.770
and how much was out of self-interest?

22:21.960 --> 22:23.220
You are a sensible man,

22:24.160 --> 22:25.890
so I won't beat around the bush.

22:28.640 --> 22:30.170
If I had no selfish motives,

22:30.310 --> 22:32.240
I wouldn't insist on marrying her.

22:32.720 --> 22:34.320
If I had no sincere feelings,

22:34.480 --> 22:37.140
I wouldn't have willingly clipped my own wings.

22:51.510 --> 22:52.510
Your Highness,

22:53.440 --> 22:54.960
please forgive my words,

22:55.720 --> 22:57.480
but the path you're on is dangerous.

22:57.480 --> 22:58.400
One wrong step,

22:58.400 --> 23:00.000
and there's no turning back.

23:00.440 --> 23:02.640
If one day you lose power,

23:03.200 --> 23:05.880
fall from a prince to a prisoner,

23:05.880 --> 23:07.400
are forced to live under someone's thumb,

23:07.400 --> 23:08.720
stripped of freedom—

23:09.350 --> 23:10.550
or worse,

23:11.920 --> 23:13.240
lose your life—

23:14.960 --> 23:17.640
how will you protect Yimeng?

23:21.680 --> 23:22.550
Your Highness.

23:25.110 --> 23:26.790
Yimeng lost her mother young.

23:27.750 --> 23:29.510
She may seem carefree,

23:30.070 --> 23:32.330
but she carries everything in her heart.

23:32.550 --> 23:34.440
In the future, if you succeed,

23:35.030 --> 23:37.200
she'll be trapped in the palace forever.

23:37.200 --> 23:38.030
If you fail,

23:39.480 --> 23:41.350
her life will be in danger.

23:44.920 --> 23:46.640
As her father,

23:47.680 --> 23:48.920
I can't accept her

23:48.920 --> 23:50.520
marrying into such a future—

23:50.680 --> 23:51.790
let alone

23:51.790 --> 23:53.440
living in constant fear

23:53.790 --> 23:55.120
for the rest of her life.

23:56.680 --> 23:57.550
Therefore,

23:58.030 --> 24:00.830
I beg you, Your Highness,

24:01.680 --> 24:03.240
please let her go.

24:04.160 --> 24:06.420
If you agree to break off the engagement,

24:07.200 --> 24:08.830
I'll owe you a great debt,

24:09.030 --> 24:10.310
and I will repay it.

24:22.790 --> 24:23.790
Please rise.

24:28.590 --> 24:29.550
I understand

24:29.880 --> 24:31.280
everything you've said.

24:32.110 --> 24:33.880
In fact, on my way back just now,

24:33.880 --> 24:34.790
I was wondering

24:36.110 --> 24:38.240
whether I should let go of my obsession

24:38.400 --> 24:39.200
and let her go.

24:46.400 --> 24:47.530
But I just can't.

24:50.270 --> 24:52.870
Everything I did before was to protect myself.

24:53.200 --> 24:54.200
But in the future,

24:54.680 --> 24:56.880
I want to clear the misunderstandings between her and me

24:56.880 --> 24:59.010
and even become her lifelong partner.

24:59.790 --> 25:00.960
I also promise you

25:01.590 --> 25:02.960
that I will do everything I can

25:02.960 --> 25:04.360
to keep her safe for life.

25:07.640 --> 25:08.440
Of course,

25:09.880 --> 25:11.480
I want to ask her opinion too.

25:12.310 --> 25:13.440
I want to give myself

25:14.070 --> 25:15.240
one last chance.

25:19.880 --> 25:21.200
So, I'm afraid I can't

25:25.830 --> 25:27.500
grant your request.

25:48.000 --> 25:49.260
Protect His Highness!

25:49.310 --> 25:50.970
Hurry, protect His Highness!

25:53.830 --> 25:55.160
What are you laughing at?

25:55.160 --> 25:56.560
What are you laughing at?

25:56.880 --> 25:59.720
This is the honorable Seventh Prince's Residence.

25:59.720 --> 26:00.510
Guarding it

26:00.920 --> 26:03.480
is our duty as royal guards.

26:03.750 --> 26:04.680
Stay alert.

26:05.350 --> 26:06.160
You guys,

26:06.270 --> 26:07.110
go check over there.

26:07.110 --> 26:07.750
Yes.

26:12.880 --> 26:14.240
I was so scared.

26:14.680 --> 26:15.640
What was that?

26:17.070 --> 26:17.920
Wait for me!

26:24.350 --> 26:25.200
Rong Hua,

26:25.200 --> 26:26.000
let's go.

26:33.670 --> 26:36.080
[Song Residence]

26:34.030 --> 26:36.190
Just let me see Miss Yiting.

26:37.270 --> 26:39.030
Although Mr. Song wasn't saved by me yesterday,

26:39.030 --> 26:40.160
I did play a part.

26:40.160 --> 26:42.020
Does Miss Yiting know about this?

26:42.350 --> 26:43.350
Just go back.

26:43.350 --> 26:44.750
Back where? Back where?

26:44.750 --> 26:45.440
Come on. Since she doesn't know,

26:45.440 --> 26:46.550
you have to tell her first.

26:46.550 --> 26:47.480
Our lady said

26:47.480 --> 26:49.480
it's absolutely impossible between you two.

26:49.480 --> 26:51.160
Please stop bothering her.

26:52.030 --> 26:52.750
When did I...

26:52.750 --> 26:53.880
How is this bothering?

26:53.880 --> 26:54.550
Come on.

26:54.550 --> 26:55.480
Open the door first.

26:55.480 --> 26:56.280
Open the door.

26:56.310 --> 26:56.770
Yiting?

26:57.440 --> 26:58.030
Yiting!

27:00.160 --> 27:00.750
It's...

27:01.160 --> 27:05.990
[Song Residence]

27:19.750 --> 27:21.030
What are you waiting for?

27:21.030 --> 27:23.240
Hurry up and call me Mother-in-law.

27:25.200 --> 27:26.480
Are you Mrs. Song?

27:27.110 --> 27:28.400
Greetings, Mrs. Song.

27:29.640 --> 27:30.400
Come on, come on.

27:30.400 --> 27:31.110
Here.

27:31.110 --> 27:32.240
Take this.

27:32.270 --> 27:35.240
Here is Song Yiting's full schedule for this month.

27:38.240 --> 27:39.070
Your Highness,

27:39.070 --> 27:41.070
I have high hopes for you.

27:41.680 --> 27:43.070
This is as far as I can help.

27:43.070 --> 27:43.830
From now on,

27:43.830 --> 27:45.830
don't let me down.

27:46.240 --> 27:47.000
I will...

27:47.000 --> 27:47.720
No.

27:48.440 --> 27:50.750
Thank you, Mother-in-law.

27:51.030 --> 27:51.790
Alright, alright.

27:51.790 --> 27:52.830
I'll go in now.

27:54.510 --> 27:55.310
Goodbye.

28:12.200 --> 28:13.070
Miss Yiting,

28:13.480 --> 28:15.160
the trendiest fabrics and dresses

28:15.160 --> 28:16.230
in our shop

28:16.510 --> 28:17.590
are all here.

28:17.880 --> 28:18.880
Take a look

28:19.160 --> 28:20.760
and see which style you like.

28:24.000 --> 28:25.830
I'll go with whatever you decide.

28:25.830 --> 28:27.110
After all, it was my mother

28:27.110 --> 28:29.160
who arranged for me to have these clothes made.

28:29.160 --> 28:31.820
There's no need to pretend to ask for my opinion.

28:32.070 --> 28:33.730
Madam did it for your own good.

28:34.510 --> 28:36.440
In the capital's noble families, every young lady

28:36.440 --> 28:39.170
has several proper dresses prepared in advance,

28:39.750 --> 28:40.960
so she's ready for the new year

28:40.960 --> 28:43.020
and the chance to find a good husband.

28:43.350 --> 28:44.720
Find a husband?

28:45.160 --> 28:46.440
Will a girl die

28:46.720 --> 28:47.640
if she doesn't?

28:50.590 --> 28:51.830
Now that my measurements are done,

28:51.830 --> 28:52.880
I'll leave now.

28:53.160 --> 28:53.960
Miss Yiting,

28:54.110 --> 28:54.960
wait.

28:55.920 --> 28:57.450
Here's an umbrella for you.

29:30.030 --> 29:30.490
Yiting,

29:31.030 --> 29:32.090
what a coincidence

29:32.150 --> 29:33.000
running into you here today.

29:33.000 --> 29:34.350
It must be fate.

29:34.350 --> 29:35.030
Perfect timing—

29:35.030 --> 29:36.480
I just booked a banquet at a restaurant.

29:36.480 --> 29:38.110
Miss Yiting, please…

29:38.110 --> 29:39.200
Eighteenth Prince,

29:39.200 --> 29:40.270
in just three days,

29:40.480 --> 29:42.410
we've run into each other 21 times.

29:42.640 --> 29:44.300
Do you think I'd believe that?

29:45.000 --> 29:47.030
Are... are there really that many times?

29:47.030 --> 29:48.480
No matter what tricks or methods

29:48.480 --> 29:49.480
you used,

29:49.480 --> 29:51.280
let me make it clear to you today.

29:51.640 --> 29:53.030
I don't like men like you

29:53.030 --> 29:54.720
who only listen to their father

29:54.720 --> 29:57.310
and spend their days doing nothing worthwhile.

29:57.310 --> 29:58.550
Stop wasting your energy.

29:58.550 --> 29:59.400
Yiting...

29:59.830 --> 30:00.640
Yiting!

30:01.160 --> 30:01.880
Jixiang,

30:01.880 --> 30:02.680
stop her!

30:05.920 --> 30:06.880
Eighteenth Prince,

30:06.880 --> 30:07.920
what are you doing?

30:07.920 --> 30:09.480
Do you have any manners or shame?

30:09.480 --> 30:10.270
Come on.

30:10.270 --> 30:12.000
I don't mean to offend you.

30:12.000 --> 30:12.750
But there's one thing

30:12.750 --> 30:13.920
I must tell you.

30:14.480 --> 30:15.200
You asked me before

30:15.200 --> 30:16.200
why I wanted to get married.

30:16.200 --> 30:16.960
I thought about it for a long time

30:16.960 --> 30:18.000
and finally figured it out.

30:18.000 --> 30:19.000
It's not because of my father,

30:19.000 --> 30:21.200
nor because I want to compete with Heng.

30:22.480 --> 30:23.270
It's because

30:38.790 --> 30:40.160
it was my mother's last wish.

30:40.160 --> 30:41.440
She was the former empress of Great Jing.

30:41.440 --> 30:42.880
You have to listen to her, right?

30:42.880 --> 30:43.480
Yiting,

30:43.480 --> 30:44.240
Yiting!

30:44.240 --> 30:44.880
Come on.

30:45.000 --> 30:45.960
My nanny told me

30:45.960 --> 30:47.310
my mother hoped that when I grew up,

30:47.310 --> 30:48.720
I would marry an educated woman.

30:48.720 --> 30:49.640
Someone I can talk to

30:49.640 --> 30:50.270
and connect with,

30:50.270 --> 30:51.640
so we can live in harmony.

30:51.640 --> 30:52.440
And my mother also said that

30:52.440 --> 30:53.480
if I marry a girl,

30:53.480 --> 30:55.110
I must love her with all my heart for life.

30:55.110 --> 30:55.570
Enough!

30:56.880 --> 30:58.030
Stop following me.

30:59.240 --> 30:59.750
Yiting!

31:00.240 --> 31:00.700
Yiting!

31:00.830 --> 31:01.680
Don't worry.

31:01.680 --> 31:03.510
Even if you and my mother both fell into the river,

31:03.510 --> 31:05.310
I'd save you first!

31:22.830 --> 31:23.640
Cherries!

31:24.440 --> 31:25.270
Cherries!

31:25.400 --> 31:26.590
Fresh cherries!

31:28.550 --> 31:29.350
Cherries!

31:30.240 --> 31:30.920
Sir,

31:30.920 --> 31:32.070
want some cherries?

31:33.590 --> 31:34.450
Are they sweet?

31:34.880 --> 31:35.960
Just try one, sir.

31:41.750 --> 31:42.550
How is it?

31:44.070 --> 31:44.880
Sweet.

31:45.480 --> 31:46.740
But not as sweet as you.

31:48.880 --> 31:49.680
Cherries!

31:49.880 --> 31:50.880
Cherries!

31:53.550 --> 31:54.480
The rain is too heavy!

31:54.480 --> 31:55.200
Run!

32:08.640 --> 32:09.720
Are you okay?

32:10.480 --> 32:11.270
We're fine.

32:12.030 --> 32:13.000
Don't get wet.

32:13.350 --> 32:14.400
Here.

32:15.070 --> 32:16.230
Thank you, sir.

32:18.240 --> 32:19.070
Be careful!

32:21.480 --> 32:22.270
Stop!

32:22.880 --> 32:24.680
Whose carriage is being so rude?

32:24.920 --> 32:26.590
My brocade robe

32:27.440 --> 32:29.040
is a new style from Jiangnan.

32:29.240 --> 32:30.030
Pay up!

32:49.510 --> 32:50.510
You pervert!

32:57.030 --> 32:58.240
This Song Yiting

32:58.960 --> 33:00.240
is so arrogant

33:00.680 --> 33:01.960
and disrespectful.

33:04.880 --> 33:06.480
There I was, a handsome and charming man,

33:06.480 --> 33:07.310
standing right in front of her,

33:07.310 --> 33:09.000
yet she called me a pervert.

33:13.790 --> 33:14.720
Is there such a handsome pervert

33:14.720 --> 33:16.230
like me?

33:16.880 --> 33:17.750
Ridiculous.

33:19.480 --> 33:20.880
It's just a robe.

33:21.350 --> 33:22.550
I'll give you the money

33:22.550 --> 33:23.610
to buy another one.

33:23.880 --> 33:25.270
Is the robe important?

33:25.480 --> 33:26.750
What matters is my whole outfit

33:26.750 --> 33:28.810
and the mood of strolling in the rain.

33:32.790 --> 33:33.680
Just you wait.

33:34.640 --> 33:37.240
I'll pull her down from that pedestal.

33:38.270 --> 33:39.270
Let me remind you,

33:39.880 --> 33:41.480
she's Song Yimeng's sister.

33:42.000 --> 33:43.160
Don't mess with her.

33:43.550 --> 33:44.550
She's not even your sister-in-law yet,

33:44.550 --> 33:46.210
and you're already meddling.

33:46.240 --> 33:47.270
I've already checked.

33:47.270 --> 33:49.160
Song Yiting was born to Mrs. Zhou

33:49.160 --> 33:51.110
and isn't close to your Yimeng.

33:51.270 --> 33:54.930
Whether they're close or not, she's still a Song family daughter.

33:55.070 --> 33:56.030
Don't forget,

33:56.750 --> 33:58.310
the matter after you saved her last time

33:58.310 --> 33:59.920
isn't over yet.

34:02.110 --> 34:03.640
Don't cause me any trouble.

34:05.590 --> 34:07.450
If there's nothing else, go back.

34:07.880 --> 34:08.880
Use the back door.

34:10.760 --> 34:12.960
I always use the back door.

34:13.630 --> 34:14.440
Also,

34:14.710 --> 34:16.400
am I the one causing her trouble?

34:16.400 --> 34:18.000
It's that woman who keeps bothering me.

34:18.000 --> 34:19.000
What can I do?

34:19.000 --> 34:20.320
Haven't I told you

34:20.400 --> 34:22.110
not to touch things in my study?

34:22.110 --> 34:22.760
You...

34:23.480 --> 34:25.400
Don't go too far in provoking me.

34:25.440 --> 34:26.400
If you really dislike me,

34:26.400 --> 34:27.880
fine, I'll quit being the Second Master.

34:27.880 --> 34:28.880
Just send me back to prison.

34:28.880 --> 34:29.840
Let's go now.

34:35.840 --> 34:36.639
It was not you?

34:40.960 --> 34:41.889
There's a thief?

34:44.120 --> 34:47.880
[Righteousness and Virtue]

34:54.989 --> 34:57.570
[Three days later]

35:36.960 --> 35:38.160
It took you three days

35:38.320 --> 35:39.650
to find the secret room.

35:39.710 --> 35:40.590
General Chu,

35:40.920 --> 35:42.000
you are useless.

35:44.400 --> 35:45.190
Tell me,

35:45.880 --> 35:47.280
what are you looking for?

35:48.280 --> 35:49.190
Nothing.

35:49.960 --> 35:51.510
There are bandits in the capital.

35:51.510 --> 35:52.670
While chasing the bandits,

35:52.670 --> 35:53.840
I stumbled in here by accident.

35:53.840 --> 35:55.280
Even before His Majesty,

35:55.840 --> 35:56.840
I'll say the same.

35:57.590 --> 36:00.520
Chasing bandits to the Seventh Prince's Residence?

36:00.920 --> 36:01.630
That excuse

36:01.630 --> 36:03.280
is way too clumsy.

36:03.760 --> 36:04.760
Whatever you say.

36:06.280 --> 36:07.190
If you leave,

36:07.550 --> 36:08.630
you will never get

36:08.960 --> 36:10.550
what you want.

36:14.070 --> 36:15.600
You came here three days ago

36:16.320 --> 36:17.800
but you were careless

36:18.280 --> 36:19.440
and left a trace.

36:20.670 --> 36:22.480
So I had Fugui watch secretly.

36:23.840 --> 36:25.240
For three days straight,

36:25.800 --> 36:28.360
you searched my entire residence.

36:28.480 --> 36:30.000
But the place you came to most

36:30.000 --> 36:31.150
was this study.

36:32.590 --> 36:33.590
So I think...

36:34.880 --> 36:35.840
this is what...

36:37.630 --> 36:38.630
you're...

36:39.050 --> 36:41.520
[Qianyu Military Manual]

36:39.290 --> 36:40.080
looking for.

36:44.070 --> 36:44.760
Nan Heng,

36:45.390 --> 36:47.840
the Qianyu Military Manual belongs to the Chu family.

36:47.840 --> 36:48.840
Give it back to me.

36:48.880 --> 36:50.360
If I remember correctly,

36:51.320 --> 36:52.850
you personally gave it to me

36:53.000 --> 36:55.150
19 years ago.

36:55.320 --> 36:56.320
Give it back to me!

37:09.030 --> 37:10.690
I gave it to a friend back then.

37:11.920 --> 37:12.590
Now,

37:15.550 --> 37:17.410
you're no longer a friend of mine.

37:31.880 --> 37:33.150
Come to think of it,

37:34.070 --> 37:35.070
once you give something away,

37:35.070 --> 37:36.630
how can you take it back?

37:36.880 --> 37:38.230
And I'm curious.

37:38.590 --> 37:40.840
Why do you want this book so badly?

37:41.230 --> 37:42.070
Is there any secret

37:42.070 --> 37:43.320
hidden in it?

37:46.960 --> 37:48.490
It's none of your business.

37:48.960 --> 37:50.560
And you have no right to know.

37:50.760 --> 37:51.550
Fine.

37:52.630 --> 37:53.840
In that case,

37:54.760 --> 37:55.550
I'll just...

38:45.230 --> 38:46.060
Nan Heng,

38:47.670 --> 38:49.990
this is the only thing my father left me!

38:55.590 --> 38:56.550
He's dead.

38:58.230 --> 38:59.880
You killed him!

39:01.000 --> 39:03.400
You keep saying I killed him.

39:04.150 --> 39:05.400
Do you have any proof?

39:11.150 --> 39:13.400
My biggest regret in this life

39:14.840 --> 39:16.400
is trusting you wrongly

39:17.320 --> 39:20.280
and having a friend like you who abandoned me in my most critical moment!

39:20.280 --> 39:21.440
I abandoned you?

39:22.360 --> 39:24.420
When I was trapped in the cold palace,

39:24.480 --> 39:25.870
who abandoned me?

39:45.840 --> 39:51.450
♪ I leave the book aside, though I haven't finished reading it ♪

39:52.360 --> 39:53.690
I will find the evidence

39:54.780 --> 40:00.520
♪ I know one day I can have a glimpse of the ending ♪

39:55.070 --> 39:56.590
for the past.

39:57.960 --> 39:59.000
From now on,

40:00.800 --> 40:02.530
I will be more ruthless than you

40:03.280 --> 40:05.590
until the day you kneel before me begging for mercy.

40:03.580 --> 40:07.720
♪ Life is unpredictable ♪

40:07.030 --> 40:07.630
Fine.

40:08.660 --> 40:11.590
♪ Who can get rid of perplexity ♪

40:09.960 --> 40:11.230
I'd like to see

40:12.450 --> 40:17.450
♪ And find the answer he yearns for? ♪

40:12.960 --> 40:14.560
just how ruthless you can be.

40:21.460 --> 40:24.610
♪ I let the wind stir my pages of the past ♪

40:26.030 --> 40:29.000
♪ Let brush and ink depict my adventures ♪

40:30.380 --> 40:36.950
♪ Let's see how many ways fate can shape my life in ♪

40:39.540 --> 40:42.490
♪ Setting sun, help me weather through the big snow ♪

40:43.340 --> 40:47.720
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter to get sorrowful ♪

40:50.180 --> 40:58.190
♪ Every word resonates with me like dancing notes on the paper ♪
